silm:instances_papers_21_ologs_and_typed_english_chapters_05_yoneda_for_typed_english_sections_01_representable_as_english_questions_concrete_anchor_4_Yoneda_lemma#yonedalemmabasetopic silm:hasLongDescription "The YonedaLemmaBaseTopic is the Yoneda lemma, base topic for representability. In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'Yoneda_lemma', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
